"af_bella|People want a human doctor because the treatment is for their own body and their own life. They want someone who listens, explains the odds honestly, and takes responsibility for the choice. In 2040, the law also says a person must sign every medical decision.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|People want a human doctor because the treatment is for their own body and their own life. They want someone who listens, explains the odds honestly, and takes responsibility for the choice. In 2040, the law also says a person must sign every medical decision.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
